# .claude/agents — upstream provenance and sync policy
#
# Same contract as .claude/templates/*/UPSTREAM: this file is the single
# source of truth for where each persona came from, and it is kept in sync
# with the AGENTS_* mappings in ops/refresh-vendored-templates.sh. Update
# both together — the drift check walks the script's mapping, and this file
# is what a human reads to understand it.
#
# Run the drift check with:
#   ops/refresh-vendored-templates.sh
# It never writes into the tree; it prints a report path for an operator to
# review and port by hand.

